   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a product of \\( 5^{x} \\) and \\( \\left(1 + \\sin(4x)\\right)^{2} \\), so the product rule comes first: \\( f'(x) = \\left(5^{x}\\right)'\\,\\left(1 + \\sin(4x)\\right)^{2} + 5^{x}\\left(\\left(1 + \\sin(4x)\\right)^{2}\\right)' \\).",
         "mathjson": [
