         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the product rule: \\( f'(x) = 5^{x} \\left(\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 1\\right)^{2} \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)} + 4 \\cdot 5^{x} \\left(2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 2\\right) \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\).",
